{"id":"d8a2cec63f9f8d53","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Fusion Limit","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit — ZFC Forcing10 Fusion Limit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit — ZFC Forcing10 Fusion Limit","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit — ZFC Forcing10 Fusion Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c1a143ccca4cbc32\" href=\"?note=c1a143ccca4cbc32\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-sequence.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq \\in V\">\\(q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}fusion\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S(q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S(s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land q\\in P\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,s(n)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}fusion\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S(q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S(s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land q\\in P\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,s(n)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A fusion limit is relative to both the forcing carrier and its sequence of fusion orders.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"c1a143ccca4cbc32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-sequence.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}fusion\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionLimit}_S(q,s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10FusionSequence}_S(s,P,\\preccurlyeq)\\land q\\in P\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,s(n)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq(n))","display":true}],"bytes":935,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2000","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-fusion-limit]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c1a143ccca4cbc32"]}